Status: Consolidated. Tier 2.

Wuxia attaches supernatural progression to a complete mundane martial Style. One complete Wuxia Style is one institutional instance.

Mastery Threshold: For Wuxia Duan Wei requirements, a skill or technique is mastered at effective level 16. A technique based on an active defense (Parry, Block, or Dodge) is mastered at effective level 10 instead.
